 `src/index.ts`.
 
 Prices are integer cents everywhere. Run the tests with `npm test`.
+
+## Discount codes
+
+An order takes one discount code at most, set with `orders.applyCode(orderNumber, code)`; a second code replaces the
+first. `SPRING10` takes 10 % off the items (a half cent rounds up); `WELCOME5` takes 5.00 € off, only on items of
+30.00 € or more. An unknown code, or `WELCOME5` on a smaller order, is refused and the order left as it was. The
+discount never touches shipping, and free shipping is decided on the items before the discount. `totals` shows the
+discount as `discountCents` (0 without a code); `totalCents` is items minus discount plus shipping.
